                <project id="10000" key="GMS">GMS</project>
                    <description>&lt;p&gt;Iz WFS je potrebno prena&#353;ati podatke upravnih aktov za to&#269;ke in parcele. Za to se naredi dva sloja.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://eprostor.gov.si/imps/srv/api/records/ff907852-18ca-426f-a100-5631ca5fa95c&quot; title=&quot;smart-link&quot; class=&quot;external-link&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow noreferrer&quot;&gt;https://eprostor.gov.si/imps/srv/api/records/ff907852-18ca-426f-a100-5631ca5fa95c&lt;/a&gt; &lt;/p&gt;

